No receiving transaction can be preformed on PO shipments in "Finally Closed" status. <Br>
Review the note: PO status affects receiving transactions (Receive, Deliver, Correct, Return, ASN) Error: APP-PO-14094  [551232/KB754685].',
      p_solution               => 'Please review the note: Is it possible to reopen a cancelled or finally closed purchase order ? [1203689/KB196930].',
      p_success_msg            => 'All Purchase order shipments are in Open status.',
      p_print_condition        => nvl('ALWAYS','ALWAYS'),
      p_fail_type              => nvl('W','W'),
      p_print_sql_output       => nvl('Y','RS'),
      p_limit_rows             => nvl('Y','Y'),
      p_extra_info             => l_info,
      p_child_sigs             => VARCHAR_TBL(),
      p_include_in_dx_summary  => nvl('P','N'),
      p_version                => '19'
      );
