      p_fail_condition         => 'RS',
      p_problem_descr          => 'There are records stuck in RCV_TRANSACTIONS_INTERFACE table, which could prevent receiving transactions. <Br>
This list excludes the records pending in BATCH mode as they get processed during the next run of Receiving Transaction Processor program.',
