[1273516/FAQ4006] - Why Are Landed Cost Management (LCM) Receipt Transactions Pending In RCV_TRANSACTIONS_INTERFACE?<br>
[1610732/KB601431] - LCM as Service Even though the RCV: Processing Mode profile is set to On-Line the transaction in the rcv_transactions_interface has processing mode code  of BATCH. Why?',
      p_success_msg            => 'There are no stuck records found in RCV_TRANSACTIONS_INTERFACE table. No action required.',
      p_print_condition        => nvl('ALWAYS','ALWAYS'),
      p_fail_type              => nvl('E','W'),
