Please note that these records do not cause any problems <strong>so long as the Receipt Number (or Shipment Number) does not need to be used again for the same Receiving Organization</strong>. This is a general check. This is not specific to the analyzer parameters.',
      p_solution               => 'Remove the orphaned records.<Br>
Datafix for Orphan Receipt or Shipment Headers (RCV_SHIPMENT_HEADERS) [977477/KB157568].',
