This document has detailed diagnosis on known issues and includes a datafix "clear_unwanted_shipment_RSS.sql" to clear unwanted serial supply records. <br>',
      p_success_msg            => 'There are no shipments with unwanted serials supply in RCV_SERIALS_SUPPLY table.<br>
Refer to [2663399/KB631511] for more details.',
      p_print_condition        => nvl('ALWAYS','ALWAYS'),
