',
      p_solution               => 'For solution, refer to the following notes: <Br>
[605300/KB482178] - How Are Failed Receiving Open Interface (ROI) Transactions Reprocessed? <Br>
[303544/KB162444] - How To Remove Pending and Error Receiving Transactions from Transaction Status Summary <Br>
