      p_fail_condition         => 'RS',
      p_problem_descr          => 'Attempting to receive Items for Internal Sales Order after canceling the associated Internal Requisition results in error as described in [2060502/KB404977]<br>
 Error : RVTII-077: ORA-01476: divisor is equal to zero',
      p_solution               => 'Implement the patching solution from [2006585/KB271669] to prevent the issue on future documents.  <br>
If a datafix is required for this document, request a datafix for corresponding [2060502/KB404977] from Oracle Support through a Service Request with ''Oracle Purchasing'' product  (or with Product ID: 502)',
      p_success_msg            => 'This requisition is not a canceled Internal Requisition having pending receipts.',
